<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Variance of the Resampling Distribution ‣ Mitigating Premature Exploitation in Particle-based Monte Carlo for Inference-Time Scaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Entropic Annealing as a Variance Reduction Technique</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
